        {
          "title": "两种约定",
          "markdown": "| | 数学教材 | PyTorch |\n|---|---|---|\n| 输入 | 列向量 $x$：in × 1 | 行堆叠 $X$：batch × in |\n| 权重 | $W$：n_out × n_in | $W_p$：out × in |\n| 前向 | $y = W x$ | $Y = X W_p^{\\top}$ |\n| 输出 | n_out × 1 | batch × out |",
          "layout": "follow"
